menu "Built_In_V6 cloud voice configuration"

config VOLC_RTC_MODE
    bool "Enable Volcano Engine high-quality RTC transport"
    default y
    help
        Build the P4-specific VolcEngine RTC client contained in the locally
        downloaded ConversationalAI Embedded Kit. Credentials are intentionally
        not Kconfig values; they are read only from the Git-ignored secrets
        header.

endmenu

config P4_SIGN_LANGUAGE_MODE
    bool "Enable demand-driven sign-language camera preview"
    default n
    help
        Adds a camera entry to the voice home screen. Only the separate sign
        build profile enables this; the stable display profile stays voice-only.

config P4_ASR_MODE
    bool "Enable standalone push-to-talk Doubao ASR"
    default n
    help
        Separate 16 kHz transcription, with no LLM/TTS. Credentials live only
        in the Git-ignored secrets/doubao_asr.h, not in Kconfig or logs.
